{"id": "blackstone-att-lobbying-payments", "title": "AT&T lobbying compensation omitted from monthly disclosures", "seconds": 40.2, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "a6dd0904fd9fb3a2", "words": 131, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "What did the public record leave out of these lobbying reports?", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.31, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Lobbying", "reports"], "sub": "32 lobbying contacts"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.37, 0.46, 0.76, 1.09, 1.28, 1.41, 1.49, 1.68, 2.07]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Cammy Blackstone worked for AT&T. The signed order counts 32 lobbying contacts.", "t0": 3.31, "t1": 8.4, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "32", "label": "32 lobbying contacts"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.39, 0.9, 1.11, 1.26, 1.64, 1.8, 2.64, 2.81, 3.1, 3.37, 3.65, 4.08, 4.44]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "What was missing was the compensation she received from her employer.", "t0": 8.52, "t1": 11.45, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "order", "kicker": "32 lobbying contacts", "text": "Employer compensation", "mark": "Employer"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.31, 0.7, 0.84, 0.95, 1.61, 1.78, 2.12, 2.28, 2.4]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The order calls for eight amended reports.", "t0": 11.67, "t1": 13.51, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "order", "kicker": "Eight in the text, eleven months listed", "text": "Eight amended reports", "mark": "Eight"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.33, 0.61, 0.77, 0.97, 1.31]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "But its list names eleven months.", "t0": 13.63, "t1": 15.31, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "Eleven months", "label": "Eight in the text, eleven months listed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.34, 0.6, 0.88, 1.22]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The filing directory resolves the difference.", "t0": 15.43, "t1": 17.44, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The filing directory"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.43, 0.9, 1.31, 1.42]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Every one of those eleven months has an amendment dated June eighth, 2021.", "t0": 17.56, "t1": 21.14, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "order", "kicker": "Eight in the text, eleven months listed", "text": "June 8, 2021", "mark": "June"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.36, 0.43, 0.62, 0.94, 1.21, 1.35, 1.44, 1.9, 2.24, 2.5, 2.77, 3.07]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Together the eleven compensation entries come to 3,410 dollars.", "t0": 21.26, "t1": 25.04, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$3,410", "label": "Eleven compensation entries"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.48, 0.77, 1.35, 1.65, 1.81, 1.92, 2.15, 2.58, 2.8, 3.05, 3.23]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "That was lobbying compensation from AT&T.", "t0": 25.16, "t1": 27.27, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Lobbying compensation from AT&T"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.29, 0.68, 1.26, 1.42, 1.71, 1.8]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Commission approved the settlement four to zero.", "t0": 27.49, "t1": 29.66, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "minutes", "kicker": "The Commission approved the settlement", "text": "The Commission approved the settlement", "mark": "The"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.52, 0.84, 0.95, 1.4, 1.64, 1.74]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The enforcement register gives a different figure for the penalty: 1,112 dollars.", "t0": 29.78, "t1": 34.68, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,112", "label": "The Commission approved the settlement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.62, 0.98, 1.18, 1.25, 1.56, 1.83, 1.93, 2.02, 3.0, 3.22, 3.68, 3.87, 4.11, 4.39]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "A City receipt would establish the collection date.", "t0": 34.8, "t1": 37.04, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The collection date"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.41, 0.77, 0.96, 1.48, 1.57, 1.99]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 37.16, "t1": 39.31, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "32 lobbying contacts", "b": "Eight in the text, eleven months listed", "o": "The Commission approved the settlement"}, "look": "map", "hook": "contrast"}